Dialogue: 6,0:26:39.47,0:26:41.99,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}If you are somewhere
Dialogue: 6,0:26:42.53,0:26:43.02,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,150)}{\blur5}Every night
Dialogue: 6,0:26:43.47,0:26:46.38,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}I still call your name
Dialogue: 6,0:26:47.25,0:26:52.23,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}That would be enough for me but please shine your light
Dialogue: 6,0:26:52.67,0:26:55.16,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}On me
