Dialogue: 6,0:27:04.86,0:27:08.37,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur10}Before I cease to be myself
Dialogue: 6,0:27:09.04,0:27:09.83,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}Find me
Dialogue: 6,0:27:12.22,0:27:17.08,Insert - EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}Your being is my light
Dialogue: 6,0:24:08.41,0:24:11.03,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}為何我得以重生
Dialogue: 6,0:24:12.43,0:24:14.92,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}為何我仍存於世
Dialogue: 6,0:24:16.39,0:24:19.27,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}行走在一條陌路
Dialogue: 6,0:24:20.35,0:24:23.02,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}將夢想扛於雙肩
Dialogue: 6,0:24:24.74,0:24:26.84,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}為何我依然堅持
Dialogue: 6,0:24:28.81,0:24:31.68,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}以微笑掩蓋痛楚
Dialogue: 6,0:24:32.57,0:24:35.78,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}行走在一條陌路
Dialogue: 6,0:24:36.35,0:24:39.77,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}隨影仍糾纏如故
Dialogue: 6,0:24:41.45,0:24:43.95,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}在人潮與霓虹燈之間
Dialogue: 6,0:24:45.41,0:24:47.64,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}在每個街角標誌旁邊
Dialogue: 6,0:24:48.43,0:24:52.21,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}我總在追尋將逝的光
Dialogue: 6,0:24:52.66,0:24:55.70,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}我明白
Dialogue: 6,0:24:56.84,0:24:57.26,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,150)}{\blur5}你是光
Dialogue: 6,0:24:57.66,0:24:59.89,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}若你身處某個地方
Dialogue: 6,0:25:00.84,0:25:01.39,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,150)}{\blur5}每個夜晚
Dialogue: 6,0:25:01.77,0:25:04.28,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}我仍然會呼喚你的名字
Dialogue: 6,0:25:05.67,0:25:10.37,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}如此足矣  只願你將光芒
Dialogue: 6,0:25:11.05,0:25:12.07,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\blur5}照我身上
Dialogue: 6,0:25:13.01,0:25:13.53,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,150)}{\blur5}你是光
Dialogue: 6,0:25:13.99,0:25:16.71,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}若你此刻就在身旁
Dialogue: 6,0:25:17.27,0:25:17.67,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,150)}{\blur5}每個夜晚
Dialogue: 6,0:25:18.06,0:25:20.04,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}我想要你唸出我的名字
Dialogue: 6,0:25:21.31,0:25:24.79,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}在我迷失自我之前
Dialogue: 6,0:25:25.25,0:25:26.43,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}請找到我
Dialogue: 6,0:25:28.48,0:25:31.08,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}你永遠是我的光
Dialogue: 6,0:25:37.88,0:25:40.85,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}為何我仍要堅持
Dialogue: 6,0:25:41.97,0:25:45.24,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}苟且於謊言之間
Dialogue: 6,0:25:45.77,0:25:48.97,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}行走在一條陌路
Dialogue: 6,0:25:49.91,0:25:52.28,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}肩上壓滿了期許
Dialogue: 6,0:25:54.70,0:25:57.33,Insert - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur5}在喧囂之中寂靜蔓延
